      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JALAPENO GEM (8) flew the lids from the middle with a slick turn of foot before finishing second (31.02) and beaten a nose over 530m at this track. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and seven minor placings to her credit. Expected to feature in the finish again. LENNY'S HONEY (5) is building an impressive record, last start scoring an all the way win (34.84) at this track in Grade 5/6 over 595m. Has a strong record here at this journey including five wins. Boasts two wins from two starts out of this box. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. RANDOM SASS (1) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at her last four runs. Last time finished 3rd on August 13 over 530m at this track behind CARE FACTOR beaten 6 lengths (31.42) in a Invitation. Well-placed to take this out. BLACK CHIP (4) is always hard to beat when he races here at this trip.",
